// 5 Caption :
"P2114944434" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Wheat><bgcolor Black>Ladies and gentlemen, we have an update for you. Maelstrom has arrived to exert control over the situation at TPN Campus! Let's go live to the scene and see if we can't hear from the champion himself!"
// 0 Sphere :
"P765680334" "<f=E4>"
// 5 Sphere :
"P1334804575" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color PowderBlue><bgcolor LightSlateGray>Maelstrom, what do you believe to be your chances of victory against these Incarnates?"
// 6 Maelstrom :
"P1680039558" "<em lecture><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>My victory is all but assured. The citizens of Praetoria should not be alarmed by the actions of these terrorists."
// 0 Maelstrom :
"P2109993093" "<em none>"
// 5 Sphere :
"P2839366491" "<x=0.7 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color PowderBlue><bgcolor LightSlateGray>Are you certain of victory? These forces have already dealt a severe blow to the Emperor's forces in the past!"
// 4 Maelstrom :
"P341043487" "<em angry><f=Sphere><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>How dare you question the might of the Emperor and his subordinates! This interview is over!"
